@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.file-pickers
@title Media loading — common file pickers
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry files-add, folder-add
@summary Trace the shared Add Files and Add Folder picker paths until they enter common Files intake or terminate.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag files

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[files-add] Add Files button <input>
- Invoke the Add Files command and open the multi-file picker @ list.PListFilesOpen(...)
> files-result

[folder-add] Add Folder button <input>
- Invoke the Add Folder command and open the multi-folder picker @ list.PListFolderOpen(...)
> folder-result

[files-result] Add Files picker outcome <decision>
- Submit selected files through the shared Files intake when the picker is accepted @ list.PListFilesOpen(...)
? "Accepted" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
? "Cancelled" > files-cancelled

[files-cancelled] Add Files cancelled <output>
= No Files intake or media-load request begins.

[folder-result] Add Folder picker outcome <decision>
- Submit selected folders through the shared Files intake when the picker is accepted @ list.PListFolderOpen(...)
? "Accepted" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
? "Cancelled" > folder-cancelled

[folder-cancelled] Add Folder cancelled <output>
= No Files intake or media-load request begins.
